## 7. Dead ends

Outputs nobody consumes. Reports nobody opens. Steps that persist for historical reasons.

For every output ask: **who reads this, and what do they do differently because of it?** A vague answer means ask the named recipient directly. **Do not recommend removal without confirming the consumer** — the one person who relies on it will surface at the worst moment.

<!-- table:operating-map.dead-ends role=register id=Output -->

| Output | Produced by | Effort | Believed consumer | Confirmed? | Source |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|

